    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Instructions: </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game contains some AI-generated art modifications. If you have any objections, please purchase with caution!<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once upon a time, there was a handsome man with five beautiful wives. They lived a happy life together. One day, a snake demon came and forcibly took his five wives to the mountains and imprisoned them, sealing their memories. During the hot summer and the Dragon Boat Festival, the snake demon's power weakened. The man then set out on a journey to rescue his wives.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Due to the special nature of the game, players who need to fully experience the game are requested to join the Steam group of this game to claim the strategy guide.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594000/extras/6b19286205d446f611b0ce307bef6b83.avif?t=1753286539\" width=1044 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594000/extras/c202f915b72759cf119d121d5932e2a8.avif?t=1753286539\" width=625 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In &quot;Sexy Slime Party&quot;, it is a game that integrates multiple game forms and methods. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the combat gameplay of this game, players will play as the snake head. In each battle, friendly units will appear one by one. Players must touch them to have them join their team, just like in the game of Snake, making the team longer and longer. Each slime has its own unique ability, and all the slimes that appear are random, so the team players assemble each time is different, providing a different experience every time. Besides, players can unlock some skills outside of battles. These skills can also grant players additional abilities, providing more assistance in battles. Finally, players can unlock talents, which can increase damage, restore health, or provide shields for players and their teammates, making players stronger and stronger. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is no longer a simple game of eating food to grow longer, but a challenging and heartwarming journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the storyline gameplay of this game, players need to carefully observe and listen, gather information from every sentence of the dialogue, piece together their wife's memories, and thus find their wife who is lost in the dream of memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Display of some NPC images</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594000/extras/4c8cce5f224018aa794027f411de671d.avif?t=1753286539\" width=483 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594000/extras/66cbd338b62baf1861ee9895a3b931ac.avif?t=1753286539\" width=415 height=930 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594000/extras/646fc7fdca5195b52f95dc32b8b52715.avif?t=1753286539\" width=335 height=980 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through the traditional training system and refuse to mindlessly repeat tasks just to unlock intimacy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Integrate into the role system in various situations and let your little quirks be fulfilled. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to the essence and reduce the unnecessary drama.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
